    <string name="notifications_planned">New notifications slide in at the top of the back screen, showing as much as you choose: just the app, who it\'s from, or the whole message. Swipe down on the back screen for the ones you haven\'t cleared.</string>
    <string name="battery_planned">When you plug in, the back screen plays a short animation with the battery level, then goes back to your wallpaper.</string>
    <string name="mirror_planned">A Quick Settings tile that moves the app you\'re using to the back screen, and brings it back with another tap.</string>
    <string name="camera_planned">Swipe left on the back screen to open Xiaomi Camera there, on the main cameras, for selfies with the best lenses.</string>

